{
  "_comment": "Action catalog shared by bin/omaoptions (generator) and Panel.qml (UI). kind: default = leave the device's own behaviour (no divert); none = divert and do nothing; key = Solaar KeyPress/MouseClick (keysyms); exec = Solaar Execute (shell command, split shell-style); native = built-in Solaar setting change; scroll = thumb-wheel scroll emulation; custom = user-typed command. scopes: which slot groups offer the action.",
